# Pages this site used to have. They were removed when the site became three
# pages — the card home page, and the two legal documents — but they were live
# long enough to be linked and indexed, so they redirect rather than 404.
#
# Both spellings of each: Cloudflare serves /about-us from about-us.html, so
# both forms were reachable and both are now dead.
#
# 301, not 302: the move is permanent and we want the old URLs to stop being
# re-crawled in their own right.
/about-us        /  301
/about-us.html   /  301
/contact-us      /  301
/contact-us.html /  301
/coming-soon     /  301
/coming-soon.html /  301

# Short links to each game's own domain, so suzyparkergames.co.uk/<game> is
# something you can say out loud. 301 because the game's domain is its
# permanent home; the :splat keeps a deep link's path (e.g.
# /the-middle-bit/how-to-play) rather than dropping it on the home page.
# The other spellings are the ones people actually type.
/the-middle-bit    https://the-middle-bit.co.uk/  301
/the-middle-bit/*  https://the-middle-bit.co.uk/:splat  301
/middlebit         https://the-middle-bit.co.uk/  301
/middle-bit        https://the-middle-bit.co.uk/  301
